rules_config.description:
Microsoft RulesEngine compatible rules stored as JSON
 Contains array of Rule objects with RuleName, Expression, SuccessEvent, etc.
 @inject_tag: gorm:"column:rules_config;not null"

user_id.description:
B2C portal bridge: set when portal access is granted via GrantPortalAccess
 RPC. Links to authn_schema.users.user_id.
 @inject_tag: gorm:"column:user_id"

session_token_hash.description:
Bcrypt hash of session token for server-side sessions (web portals)
 Only populated when session_type = SERVER_SIDE
 @inject_tag: gorm:"column:session_token_hash"

session_type.description:
Session type determines authentication method (SERVER_SIDE for web, JWT for
 mobile)
 @inject_tag: gorm:"column:session_type;not null;serializer:proto_enum"
